# Input

```svelte
<script>
    const a = true;
</script>

<div>I need to adhere sadly</div>

<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->

<div      > format madness here </div>

<p>
    I'm
    freeeee!
</p>

<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->

<div>I need to adhere sadly</div>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -8,10 +8,7 @@
 
 <div      > format madness here </div>
 
-<p>
-    I'm
-    freeeee!
-</p>
+<p>I'm freeeee!</p>
 
 <!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
 
```

